},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3m0","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3lz","text":"Superior Sound Quality: Provides superb sound quality with minimal distortion or echo.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3m2","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3m1","text":"Wireless Audio Routing: Transmits sounds from the poorer-hearing ear to the better-hearing ear wirelessly.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3m4","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3m3","text":"Versatile Fitting Options: Can be fitted as either a true CROS or BiCROS, catering to various hearing loss needs.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3m6","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3m5","text":"Advanced Battery Efficiency: Uses three times less power than other wireless CROS solutions.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3m8","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3m7","text":"Compatibility: Compatible with the EVOKE family hearing aids.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ma","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3m9","text":"Widex Moment ITE","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mc","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mb","text":"Ensuring a perfect fit isn’t always easy, but Widex’s custom in-the-ear (ITE) devices allow you to craft a hearing aid that fits true to your specific ear anatomy. All Widex ITE hearing aids and completely-in-canal (CIC) hearing aids are fully automatic. This allows you to hear clear and natural sounds with minimal intervention.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3me","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3md","text":"Widex Moment ITE products are appropriate for minimal to moderately severe hearing loss. There is an option for size 10 or 312 disposable batteries. The anticipated battery life varies greatly depending on the severity of the hearing loss, usage, and streaming frequency. Widex shares that the average usage can range between 105 and 150 hours.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mg","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mf","text":"Unique Perks and Features:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mi","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mh","text":"Tailored Fit: Custom products that are designed to be tailored to your ear anatomy","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mk","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mj","text":"Connectivity: Streaming and Bluetooth are available to control programs and volume with a DEX device or the TONELINK™ app.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mm","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3ml","text":"Tinnitus Relief: Tinnitus management is available in the Zen programs, which aim to reduce tinnitus perception by utilizing fractal tones, sounds, and other masking options","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mo","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mn","text":"Assistive Listening Devices & Technology by Widex","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mq","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mp","text":"Widex TV Play","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ms","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mr","text":"Widex Moment™ devices connect seamlessly with TV Play. This means you can stream the sound of your TV directly to your hearing aids with incredibly natural sound quality. This makes TV, movies, and games truly immersive and more enjoyable.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mu","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mt","text":"Widex Sound Assist™","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3mw","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mv","text":"This product connects to your hearing aids to provide a tabletop microphone, hands-free, and remote-control functionality. Some scenarios where this can come in handy include partner conversations in noise, table microphone use in a busy dining room, group conversations, hands-free phone calls, and more.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3my","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mx","text":"Widex Sound Assist","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3n0","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3mz","text":"Com-Dex","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3n2","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3n1","text":"RC-Dex","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3n4","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3n3","text":"TV-Dex","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3n6","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3n5","text":"Older Widex Hearing Aid Models Supported By New Leaf Hearing Care","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3n8","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3n7","text":"These hearing aid models may still be supported for hearing aid servicing and repair by New Leaf Hearing Care in Arvada, CO and Littleton, CO. Please contact us for more information.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3na","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3n9","text":"Widex Evoke","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nc","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nb","text":"Widex Beyond","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ne","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nd","text":"Widex Unique","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ng","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nf","text":"Widex Dream","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ni","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nh","text":"Frequently Asked Questions About Widex Hearing Aids","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nk","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nj","text":"What is the top-of-the-line Widex hearing aid?","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nm","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nl","text":"Widex Moment Sheer 440 is the top technology level available in the line. The 440 comes with a complete set of sound processing features, including wind noise reduction, speech enhancement, and 15 adjustment bands of customization for your audiologist.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3no","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nn","text":"What are the levels of Widex Moment?","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nq","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3np","text":"There are three levels available in the Widex Moment platform:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ns","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nr","text":"Widex Moment 220: Basic Level","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nu","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nt","text":"Widex Moment 330: Standard Level","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3nw","style":"normal","listItem":"bullet","level":1,"markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nv","text":"Widex Moment 440: Premium Level","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3ny","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nx","text":"Is Widex Moment good for tinnitus?","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k3o0","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k3nz","text":"Yes, the Widex Moment™ app provides access to your tinnitus solution to help manage your tinnitus, relaxation, well-being, and concentration. The Widex app offers “Made for You” and “Create Your Own” features for Moment devices, which allow you to customize your hearing aid fitting.","marks":[]}]}]';
